      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 体积 $V_1=0.5$ 米$^3$ 的密闭容器中盛有 $m=0.5$ 千克的",
        "水. 加热到温度 $t=147^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$. 为了使其中只有饱和汽，容器的",
        "体积要改变多大 $\\Delta V$？温度 $t=147^\\circ\\mathrm{C}$ 时饱和汽压等于 $p_0=$",
        "$4.7\\times10^6$ 牛顿/米$^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**解**：压强为 $p_0$ 时饱和汽所占有的体积"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$V=\\frac{mRT}{p_0\\mu},$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式中 $\\mu=0.018$ 千克/摩尔——水的摩尔质量. 容器的体积",
        "$V_1>V$，因而汽不是饱和汽. 为了使汽变为饱和汽，容器的体",
        "积应改变"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\Delta V=V-V_1=\\frac{mRT}{p_0\\mu}-V_1;$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\Delta V\\approx-0.3$ 米$^3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "即容器的体积应当减小 $0.3$ 米$^3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "练习 5"
      ]
    },
